## Interface: 16001
## Title: Chronolog-Forever
## Notes: Tracks per-level time (combat, travel, AFK, dead), where you spent it, kills, XP, gold and reputation, with pace splits, level ETA, charts, a widget and export.
## Author: Me and my pal Claude
## Version: 1.6.0
## IconTexture: Interface\Icons\INV_Misc_PocketWatch_01
## AddonCompartmentFunc: ChronologForever_OnAddonCompartmentClick
